    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/c9bf2359b0cc524736743f9203096d0c.poster.avif?t=1751628309\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/c9bf2359b0cc524736743f9203096d0c.webm?t=1751628309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/c9bf2359b0cc524736743f9203096d0c.mp4?t=1751628309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/bb94203819266fcdf26b4c5ebc897a37.poster.avif?t=1751628309\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/bb94203819266fcdf26b4c5ebc897a37.webm?t=1751628309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/bb94203819266fcdf26b4c5ebc897a37.mp4?t=1751628309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to Touhou Volleyball \u2014 a fast-paced, casual sports game where your favorite characters from the Touhou Project take their battles to the volleyball court!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this casual volleyball, iconic residents of Gensokyo face off in chaotic 1v1 matches filled with high jumps, and over-the-top spikes. Whether you're a longtime Touhou fan or just looking for a fun and easy-to-pick-up party game, Touhou Volleyball brings the charm and challenge in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master each character\u2019s unique playstyle  as you serve, receive, and spike your way to victory. Every match is a test of timing, reactions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Play as your favorite Touhou characters in a brand new setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd0 Fast-paced 1v1 volleyball action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Simple controls, easy to pick up \u2014 but hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Versus mode for online play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Cute and colorful visuals that capture the spirit of Gensokyo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/c9bf2359b0cc524736743f9203096d0c.poster.avif?t=1751628309\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/c9bf2359b0cc524736743f9203096d0c.webm?t=1751628309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/c9bf2359b0cc524736743f9203096d0c.mp4?t=1751628309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/bb94203819266fcdf26b4c5ebc897a37.poster.avif?t=1751628309\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/bb94203819266fcdf26b4c5ebc897a37.webm?t=1751628309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813380/extras/bb94203819266fcdf26b4c5ebc897a37.mp4?t=1751628309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to Touhou Volleyball \u2014 a fast-paced, casual sports game where your favorite characters from the Touhou Project take their battles to the volleyball court!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this casual volleyball, iconic residents of Gensokyo face off in chaotic 1v1 matches filled with high jumps, and over-the-top spikes. Whether you're a longtime Touhou fan or just looking for a fun and easy-to-pick-up party game, Touhou Volleyball brings the charm and challenge in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master each character\u2019s unique playstyle  as you serve, receive, and spike your way to victory. Every match is a test